WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You finished the page. Did you remember it?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Music may help you begin. That isn't the same as reading accurately.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Sixty-five reading studies found small average costs from sound, especially intelligible words and lyrics.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Before buying a focus soundtrack, compare the package, the evidence and a free alternative.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:42.000
None of these studies tested Zen12. Read the sources and make the decision your own.
